#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:4
msgid "v4.7.0"
msgstr "v4.7.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.7.0 is a large NPU- and ROMFS-focused release built on Qt Creator 14.0.2."
" It introduces an on-device ROM filesystem workflow with integrated ARM "
"Ethos-U (Vela) and ST Edge AI model compilers, adds STM32CubeProgrammer-"
"based factory programming for the OpenMV N6, and bundles OpenMV firmware "
"4.7.0 across every board. Note that upgrading any camera from a pre-4.7.0 "
"firmware now forces a FAT filesystem erase and ROMFS reset, which wipes "
"files stored on the device's internal flash; see **Breaking changes** below."
msgstr ""
"v4.7.0 是一次以 NPU 與 ROMFS 為核心的大型版本，建構於 Qt Creator 14.0.2 之上。它導入了裝置端的 ROM "
"檔案系統工作流程，並整合了 ARM Ethos-U（Vela）與 ST Edge AI 模型編譯器，為 OpenMV N6 新增了以 "
"STM32CubeProgrammer 為基礎的出廠燒錄功能，並在所有開發板上隨附 OpenMV 韌體 4.7.0。請注意，現在將任何相機從 4.7.0"
" 之前的韌體升級時，會強制執行 FAT 檔案系統清除與 ROMFS 重置，這會抹除儲存在裝置內部快閃記憶體中的檔案；詳見下方的 **Breaking "
"changes**\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重點摘要"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**ROM File System workflow** lets you create, edit, flash, and reset an on-"
"device read-only filesystem so ML models can be stored on the camera, "
"integrated across the DFU, IMX, Bossac, Picotool, and Arduino-DFU "
"bootloaders. (`efcc52fd8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/efcc52fd8>`__, `f2cbcc802 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f2cbcc802>`__, `a7e52424a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a7e52424a>`__, `60b05326d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/60b05326d>`__, `7140fc2aa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7140fc2aa>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**ROM 檔案系統工作流程** 讓你可以建立、編輯、燒錄與重置裝置端的唯讀檔案系統，以便將 ML 模型儲存在相機上，並整合至 "
"DFU、IMX、Bossac、Picotool 與 Arduino-DFU 開機載入程式。 (`efcc52fd8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/efcc52fd8>`__, `f2cbcc802 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f2cbcc802>`__, `a7e52424a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a7e52424a>`__, `60b05326d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/60b05326d>`__, `7140fc2aa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7140fc2aa>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"**ARM Ethos-U Vela** and **ST Edge AI** model compilers are now integrated "
"so ``.tflite``/``.onnx`` models are automatically compiled to the NPU when "
"loaded onto Ethos-U55 (OpenMV AE3) or Neural-ART (OpenMV N6) boards. "
"(`411f708ea <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/411f708ea>`__, "
"`3064411ad <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3064411ad>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**ARM Ethos-U Vela** 與 **ST Edge AI** 模型編譯器現已整合，因此當 ``.tflite``/``.onnx`` "
"模型載入到 Ethos-U55（OpenMV AE3）或 Neural-ART（OpenMV N6）開發板時，會自動編譯至 NPU。 "
"(`411f708ea <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/411f708ea>`__, "
"`3064411ad <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3064411ad>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:36
msgid ""
"**STM32CubeProgrammer** is now bundled to enable factory programming of the "
"OpenMV N6 (STM32N657) bootloader via a ``FlashLayout.tsv``. (`334b04dbd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/334b04dbd>`__, `54fea4d57 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/54fea4d57>`__, `28cc94a6e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/28cc94a6e>`__)"
msgstr ""
"現已隨附 **STM32CubeProgrammer**\\ ，可透過 ``FlashLayout.tsv`` 對 OpenMV "
"N6（STM32N657）開機載入程式進行出廠燒錄。 (`334b04dbd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/334b04dbd>`__, `54fea4d57 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/54fea4d57>`__, `28cc94a6e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/28cc94a6e>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Model Zoo browser** gains a \"Filter models by board type\" checkbox "
"driven by a new ``models/index.csv`` table that hides models incompatible "
"with the connected board. (`80adb2079 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/80adb2079>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Model Zoo 瀏覽器** 新增了「Filter models by board type」核取方塊，由全新的 "
"``models/index.csv`` 表格驅動，可隱藏與所連接開發板不相容的模型。 (`80adb2079 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/80adb2079>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Per-extension ROMFS alignment**: the ROMFS image editor now sorts files "
"alphabetically and packs them using byte-alignment rules from "
"``settings.json`` (e.g. ``.tflite`` models aligned to 16 bytes). (`e87b2bf06"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e87b2bf06>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**各副檔名的 ROMFS 對齊**\\ ：ROMFS 映像編輯器現在會將檔案依字母順序排序，並依據 ``settings.json`` "
"中的位元組對齊規則進行封裝（例如 ``.tflite`` 模型對齊至 16 位元組）。 (`e87b2bf06 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e87b2bf06>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware updated to 4.7.0** across all OpenMV and Arduino boards. "
"(`6d04b1b50 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d04b1b50>`__, "
"`d0bbb1fe7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d0bbb1fe7>`__, "
"`d7d3120b3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d7d3120b3>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**隨附韌體更新至 4.7.0**\\ ，涵蓋所有 OpenMV 與 Arduino 開發板。 (`6d04b1b50 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d04b1b50>`__, `d0bbb1fe7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d0bbb1fe7>`__, `d7d3120b3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d7d3120b3>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:55
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"**ROM File System submenu** (``New`` / ``Open`` / ``Edit ROMFS on OpenMV "
"Cam`` / ``Reset ROMFS on OpenMV Cam``) replaces the old single ``Edit ROM "
"File System`` action. (`0bc275a0a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0bc275a0a>`__, `958f732b5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/958f732b5>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**ROM 檔案系統子選單**\\ （\\ ``New`` / ``Open`` / ``Edit ROMFS on OpenMV Cam`` / "
"``Reset ROMFS on OpenMV Cam``\\ ）取代了舊有的單一 ``Edit ROM File System`` 動作。 "
"(`0bc275a0a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0bc275a0a>`__, "
"`958f732b5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/958f732b5>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Open Model Zoo browser** with persistent selected-model state and a "
"selection-change preview, including bundled STMicroelectronics, Qualcomm, "
"DeGirum, Edge Impulse, and Google model libraries. (`58033c5df "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/58033c5df>`__, `2a1fb071a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2a1fb071a>`__, `48c5b96fe "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/48c5b96fe>`__, `c0959833c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c0959833c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**開啟 Model Zoo 瀏覽器**\\ ，具備持續保存的選定模型狀態與選取變更預覽，並隨附 "
"STMicroelectronics、Qualcomm、DeGirum、Edge Impulse 與 Google 的模型庫。 (`58033c5df "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/58033c5df>`__, `2a1fb071a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2a1fb071a>`__, `48c5b96fe "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/48c5b96fe>`__, `c0959833c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c0959833c>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Convert Model for NPU** menu item under ``Machine Vision Tools`` compiles "
"a TensorFlow Lite (``.tflite``) or ONNX (``.onnx``) model for the board's "
"NPU accelerator (Vela for Ethos-U ``.tflite``, ST Edge AI for the N6 Neural-"
"ART ``.tflite``/``.onnx``) and saves the converted model to disk or the "
"camera. (`3913f5b8b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3913f5b8b>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``Machine Vision Tools`` 下的 **Convert Model for NPU** 選單項目，可為開發板的 NPU 加速器編譯 "
"TensorFlow Lite（\\ ``.tflite``\\ ）或 ONNX（\\ ``.onnx``\\ ）模型（Ethos-U 的 "
"``.tflite`` 使用 Vela，N6 Neural-ART 的 ``.tflite``/``.onnx`` 使用 ST Edge "
"AI），並將轉換後的模型儲存至磁碟或相機。 (`3913f5b8b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3913f5b8b>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Copy/Convert Python File** tool copies a Python script to the camera or "
"disk and optionally cross-compiles it to MicroPython ``.mpy`` bytecode via "
"``mpy-cross``; it lives in a new ``MicroPython Tools`` submenu under "
"``Tools``. (`e9d7fa143 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e9d7fa143>`__, `47188c0e3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/47188c0e3>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Copy/Convert Python File** 工具可將 Python 指令碼複製到相機或磁碟，並可選擇透過 ``mpy-cross`` "
"將其交叉編譯為 MicroPython ``.mpy`` 位元組碼；此工具位於 ``Tools`` 下全新的 ``MicroPython Tools``"
" 子選單中。 (`e9d7fa143 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e9d7fa143>`__, `47188c0e3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/47188c0e3>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Wrap Text** toggle buttons were added to the OpenMV serial terminal and "
"the ``General Messages`` output pane; both word-wrap their output and "
"persist the setting across sessions. (`8c052845a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8c052845a>`__, `51d3e1ad6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/51d3e1ad6>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在 OpenMV 序列終端機與 ``General Messages`` 輸出窗格中新增了 **Wrap Text** "
"切換按鈕；兩者都會對輸出進行自動換行，並在工作階段之間保留此設定。 (`8c052845a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8c052845a>`__, `51d3e1ad6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/51d3e1ad6>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:85
msgid ""
"**mpy-cross ROMFS cross-compilation** with per-board architecture flags "
"(``armv7emsp``/``armv7emdp``) lets MicroPython scripts be frozen into ROMFS "
"images. (`8c71548df <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8c71548df>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**mpy-cross ROMFS 交叉編譯** 具備各開發板的架構旗標（\\ ``armv7emsp``/``armv7emdp``\\ ），讓 "
"MicroPython 指令碼可凍結至 ROMFS 映像中。 (`8c71548df <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8c71548df>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:89
msgid ""
"The firmware bootloader dialog now accepts ``*.img`` ROMFS files alongside "
"``*.bin`` and ``*.dfu``, validates per-bootloader extensions, and disables "
"the existing ``Reset ROMFS file system`` checkbox when loading an ``*.img`` "
"file. (`79f348b36 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/79f348b36>`__)"
msgstr ""
"韌體開機載入程式對話框現在除了 ``*.bin`` 與 ``*.dfu`` 之外，也接受 ``*.img`` ROMFS "
"檔案，會驗證各開機載入程式的副檔名，並在載入 ``*.img`` 檔案時停用現有的 ``Reset ROMFS file system`` 核取方塊。 "
"(`79f348b36 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/79f348b36>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:93
msgid ""
"Pre-4.7.0 upgrades now force the FAT-erase and ROMFS reset/update checkboxes"
" on and warn that upgrading requires erasing the FAT filesystem. (`f6f3355b0"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f6f3355b0>`__)"
msgstr ""
"4.7.0 之前版本的升級現在會強制開啟 FAT 清除與 ROMFS 重置/更新核取方塊，並警告升級需要清除 FAT 檔案系統。 (`f6f3355b0"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f6f3355b0>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:98
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他變更與改進"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:100
msgid ""
"Reorganized the bundled Qualcomm model zoo into task-based folders "
"(``image_classification``, ``object_detection``, ``pose_estimation``, "
"``semantic_segmentation``, ``depth_estimation``), removed unsupported large "
"models (YOLOv7, YOLOv8, deeplabv3, mobilenet_v2), and added ``resnet18`` and"
" ``densenet_121`` (with broader board compatibility), plus ``facemap_3dmm`` "
"and ``FFNet_40S`` (AE3/N6 only). (`300ce2fc2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/300ce2fc2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"將隨附的 Qualcomm model zoo 重新整理為以任務分類的資料夾（\\ ``image_classification``\\ 、\\ "
"``object_detection``\\ 、\\ ``pose_estimation``\\ 、\\ "
"``semantic_segmentation``\\ 、\\ ``depth_estimation``\\ "
"），移除了不支援的大型模型（YOLOv7、YOLOv8、deeplabv3、mobilenet_v2），新增了 ``resnet18`` 與 "
"``densenet_121``\\ （具備更廣的開發板相容性），以及 ``facemap_3dmm`` 與 ``FFNet_40S``\\ （僅限 "
"AE3/N6）。 (`300ce2fc2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/300ce2fc2>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:107
msgid ""
"Added a new Edge Impulse model vendor (FOMO face-detection model) and new "
"Google models (``micro_speech``, ``mnist_lstm``, ``person_detection``) to "
"the bundled model zoo, and added a ``View/Edit`` action to the ROMFS editor "
"context menu. (`80adb2079 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/80adb2079>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在隨附的 model zoo 中新增了一個新的 Edge Impulse 模型供應商（FOMO 人臉偵測模型）與新的 Google 模型（\\ "
"``micro_speech``\\ 、\\ ``mnist_lstm``\\ 、\\ ``person_detection``\\ ），並在 "
"ROMFS 編輯器的右鍵選單中新增了 ``View/Edit`` 動作。 (`80adb2079 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/80adb2079>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:112
msgid ""
"Cleaned up model-zoo links: added the Qualcomm ``face_attrib_net`` model "
"(AE3/N6), removed the broken YOLO-NAS entry, and corrected board "
"compatibility filters for several STMicroelectronics object-detection "
"models. (`fd639bda0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/fd639bda0>`__)"
msgstr ""
"整理了 model-zoo 連結：新增 Qualcomm ``face_attrib_net`` 模型（AE3/N6），移除了損壞的 YOLO-NAS "
"項目，並修正了多個 STMicroelectronics 物件偵測模型的開發板相容性篩選器。 (`fd639bda0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/fd639bda0>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:116
msgid ""
"Added more model labels, switched one model's NPU accelerator config from "
"``stai`` to ``stedgeai``, and broadened the ``st_yolo_x`` board-"
"compatibility filter (now also OPENMV_RT1060, OPENMV4P, ARDUINO_GIGA, "
"PORTENTA_H7, and NICLA_VISION in addition to AE3/N6). (`1515631ce "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1515631ce>`__)"
msgstr ""
"新增了更多模型標籤，將某個模型的 NPU 加速器設定從 ``stai`` 切換為 ``stedgeai``\\ ，並擴大了 ``st_yolo_x`` "
"的開發板相容性篩選器（除了 AE3/N6 之外，現在也包含 "
"OPENMV_RT1060、OPENMV4P、ARDUINO_GIGA、PORTENTA_H7 與 NICLA_VISION）。 (`1515631ce"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1515631ce>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:121
msgid ""
"Adding a ``.tflite`` model to ROMFS now skips Vela/Ethos-U compilation if "
"the model is already Ethos-U compiled (it is just copied), and the dialog "
"action was renamed from ``Add Model`` to ``Model Zoo``. (`9c0b178fa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9c0b178fa>`__)"
msgstr ""
"若 ``.tflite`` 模型已經過 Ethos-U 編譯，現在將其加入 ROMFS 時會略過 Vela/Ethos-U "
"編譯（僅進行複製），且該對話框動作已從 ``Add Model`` 更名為 ``Model Zoo``\\ 。 (`9c0b178fa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9c0b178fa>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:125
msgid ""
"ST Edge AI compilation skips conversion for models already in the ``NBIN`` "
"format. (`3064411ad <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3064411ad>`__)"
msgstr ""
"對於已經是 ``NBIN`` 格式的模型，ST Edge AI 編譯會略過轉換。 (`3064411ad "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3064411ad>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:128
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Vela compiler dialog parses the model's reported SRAM usage against each"
" board's configured heap size and shows a percentage with warnings/errors "
"when the model exceeds 90% or 100% of available heap. (`7140fc2aa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7140fc2aa>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Vela 編譯器對話框會解析模型回報的 SRAM 用量，並與各開發板設定的 heap 大小進行比對，顯示百分比，並在模型超過可用 heap 的 90% "
"或 100% 時顯示警告/錯誤。 (`7140fc2aa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7140fc2aa>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:132
msgid ""
"The Vela compiler now reports a clear \"not supported on this platform\" "
"error instead of failing silently, and dropping a model into the model zoo "
"no longer requires Vela to be present. (`c736dd54d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c736dd54d>`__, `0ad7fd705 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ad7fd705>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Vela 編譯器現在會回報清楚的「not supported on this platform」錯誤，而非無聲失敗，且將模型放入 model zoo "
"時不再需要 Vela 存在。 (`c736dd54d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c736dd54d>`__, `0ad7fd705 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0ad7fd705>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:137
msgid ""
"The Vela Ethos-U compiler now runs via the bundled embedded Python runtime "
"(``python -m ethosu.vela``) instead of a standalone binary. (`52f9b8820 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/52f9b8820>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Vela Ethos-U 編譯器現在透過隨附的內嵌 Python 執行環境（\\ ``python -m ethosu.vela``\\ "
"）執行，而非使用獨立的二進位檔。 (`52f9b8820 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/52f9b8820>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:140
msgid ""
"Long-running ST Edge AI and Vela model-compilation dialogs now show a \"This"
" command takes a while to execute. Please be patient.\" notice. (`fc9ac2ab5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/fc9ac2ab5>`__)"
msgstr ""
"長時間執行的 ST Edge AI 與 Vela 模型編譯對話框現在會顯示「This command takes a while to execute."
" Please be patient.」的提示。 (`fc9ac2ab5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/fc9ac2ab5>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:143
msgid ""
"Opening examples or new scripts on PAG7936 (N6/AE3) and PS5520 sensors now "
"automatically bumps ``sensor.set_framesize(QVGA)`` to ``VGA`` for the "
"higher-resolution sensors. (`dfc27dd25 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/dfc27dd25>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在 PAG7936（N6/AE3）與 PS5520 感測器上開啟範例或新指令碼時，現在會自動將 "
"``sensor.set_framesize(QVGA)`` 提升為 ``VGA``\\ ，以配合這些更高解析度的感測器。 (`dfc27dd25 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dfc27dd25>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:147
msgid ""
"Added auto-fixup of example scripts for FLIR Boson 320/640 thermal cameras, "
"PixArt PAG7920/PAJ6100, FROGEYE2020, and the Prophesee GENX320 event camera."
" (`1f54ad01b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1f54ad01b>`__)"
msgstr ""
"新增了針對 FLIR Boson 320/640 熱像相機、PixArt PAG7920/PAJ6100、FROGEYE2020 與 Prophesee"
" GENX320 事件相機的範例指令碼自動修正。 (`1f54ad01b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1f54ad01b>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:150
msgid ""
"Downloadable IDE resources (firmware/models/docs) now install to a shared "
"all-users application-data directory via a new "
"``ICore::allUsersResourcePath()`` API, with the resource version manifest "
"stored in an ``OpenMVIDE.json`` file one level above the all-users resource "
"folder. (`be308ace2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/be308ace2>`__, `7c7dddb87 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7c7dddb87>`__)"
msgstr ""
"可下載的 IDE 資源（韌體/模型/文件）現在會透過全新的 ``ICore::allUsersResourcePath()`` API "
"安裝至共用的全使用者應用程式資料目錄，資源版本資訊清單則儲存在全使用者資源資料夾上一層的 ``OpenMVIDE.json`` 檔案中。 "
"(`be308ace2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/be308ace2>`__, "
"`7c7dddb87 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7c7dddb87>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"During Alif system-package firmware updates the IDE now prompts the user to "
"power-cycle (disconnect and reconnect) the camera before continuing. "
"(`162d128f9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/162d128f9>`__, "
"`756611696 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/756611696>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在 Alif 系統套件韌體更新期間，IDE 現在會提示使用者在繼續之前重新上電（拔除並重新連接）相機。 (`162d128f9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/162d128f9>`__, `756611696 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/756611696>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:161
msgid ""
"Reworked the Alif (Ensemble) bootloader/firmware download flow to be ROMFS-"
"compatible: it generates the App TOC after writing the bootloader, copies "
"bin/sign images into an ``images/`` subfolder, and flashes "
"``firmware_pad.toc``. (`f623c9231 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f623c9231>`__)"
msgstr ""
"重新調整了 Alif（Ensemble）開機載入程式/韌體下載流程使其相容於 ROMFS：它會在寫入開機載入程式後產生 App TOC，將 "
"bin/sign 映像複製到 ``images/`` 子資料夾中，並燒錄 ``firmware_pad.toc``\\ 。 (`f623c9231 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f623c9231>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:166
msgid ""
"Simplified board display names in the firmware selector by dropping the "
"redundant chip-in-parentheses suffixes and the \"Legacy\" tags (e.g. "
"\"OpenMV Cam H7 (STM32H743)\" becomes \"OpenMV Cam H7\"). (`334b04dbd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/334b04dbd>`__)"
msgstr ""
"簡化了韌體選擇器中的開發板顯示名稱，移除了多餘的括號內晶片字尾與「Legacy」標籤（例如「OpenMV Cam H7 "
"(STM32H743)」變成「OpenMV Cam H7」）。 (`334b04dbd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/334b04dbd>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:170
msgid ""
"Renamed two Tools-menu actions for clarity: ``Run Bootloader (Load "
"Firmware)`` is now ``Load Custom Firmware``, and ``Erase Onboard Data "
"Flash`` is now ``Erase Internal FAT File System`` (the confirmation dialog "
"now refers to the camera's internal FAT file system). (`0bc275a0a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0bc275a0a>`__)"
msgstr ""
"為求清晰，重新命名了兩個 Tools 選單動作：\\ ``Run Bootloader (Load Firmware)`` 現在是 ``Load "
"Custom Firmware``\\ ，而 ``Erase Onboard Data Flash`` 現在是 ``Erase Internal FAT"
" File System``\\ （確認對話框現在指的是相機的內部 FAT 檔案系統）。 (`0bc275a0a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0bc275a0a>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:175
msgid ""
"Restored the ``Ctrl+Shift+L`` (Load Custom Firmware) and ``Ctrl+Shift+E`` "
"(Erase Internal FAT File System) keyboard shortcuts, and moved the "
"``Preferences`` item back into the ``Edit`` menu. (`dabb6f7d9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dabb6f7d9>`__, `b5daf59a6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b5daf59a6>`__)"
msgstr ""
"還原了 ``Ctrl+Shift+L``\\ （Load Custom Firmware）與 ``Ctrl+Shift+E``\\ （Erase "
"Internal FAT File System）鍵盤快速鍵，並將 ``Preferences`` 項目移回 ``Edit`` 選單。 "
"(`dabb6f7d9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dabb6f7d9>`__, "
"`b5daf59a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b5daf59a6>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:180
msgid ""
"Disabled automatic C/C++ compiler and toolchain auto-detection at startup, "
"since the IDE targets MicroPython. (`f42fcc8f2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f42fcc8f2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"由於 IDE 以 MicroPython 為目標，已停用啟動時自動偵測 C/C++ 編譯器與工具鏈的功能。 (`f42fcc8f2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f42fcc8f2>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:183
msgid ""
"Added the Alif Semiconductor partner logo (light/dark) to the ``About`` "
"dialog partners section. (`4878781bb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4878781bb>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在 ``About`` 對話框的合作夥伴區段新增了 Alif Semiconductor 合作夥伴標誌（淺色/深色）。 (`4878781bb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4878781bb>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:186
msgid ""
"Reading the connected board's firmware can now flush stale serial-port data "
"before issuing the command, improving reliability of firmware/version "
"queries. (`c15a46f5b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c15a46f5b>`__)"
msgstr ""
"讀取已連接開發板的韌體時，現在可在發出命令前清空過時的序列埠資料，提升韌體/版本查詢的可靠性。 (`c15a46f5b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c15a46f5b>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:189
msgid ""
"Improved ROMFS connection reliability by forcing a reconnect/refresh on "
"ROMFS read, write, and reset operations. (`f9bc83007 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f9bc83007>`__)"
msgstr ""
"透過在 ROMFS 讀取、寫入與重置操作時強制重新連接/重新整理，改善了 ROMFS 連線的可靠性。 (`f9bc83007 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f9bc83007>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:194
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:196
msgid ""
"Fixed model/script save dialogs and ROMFS add-file/add-model to use the "
"simple file suffix instead of the complete suffix, preventing mangled "
"extensions when renaming files with dots in their names. (`52c6820d2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/52c6820d2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了模型/指令碼儲存對話框以及 ROMFS "
"新增檔案/新增模型功能，使其使用簡單副檔名而非完整副檔名，避免在重新命名名稱中含有點號的檔案時造成副檔名損毀。 (`52c6820d2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/52c6820d2>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:200
msgid ""
"Fixed a DFU upload progress-bar overflow on large transfers by computing the"
" percentage with 64-bit arithmetic. (`4b91ff2ba "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4b91ff2ba>`__)"
msgstr ""
"透過以 64 位元運算計算百分比，修正了大型傳輸時 DFU 上傳進度列溢位的問題。 (`4b91ff2ba "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4b91ff2ba>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:203
msgid ""
"Fixed flashing of older OpenMV firmware/bootloaders by guarding flash erase "
"and program steps against invalid (non-positive) flash sector ranges and "
"showing an explicit error instead of crashing, and fixed the ROMFS-access "
"guard during old-firmware upgrade. (`ae2cc15b4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ae2cc15b4>`__, `235dbdb10 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/235dbdb10>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了較舊 OpenMV "
"韌體/開機載入程式的燒錄問題，方法是針對無效（非正值）的快閃記憶體磁區範圍對快閃記憶體清除與程式燒錄步驟加上保護並顯示明確的錯誤而非當機，同時修正了舊韌體升級期間的"
" ROMFS 存取保護。 (`ae2cc15b4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ae2cc15b4>`__, `235dbdb10 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/235dbdb10>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:209
msgid ""
"Fixed serial-port board detection so the serial-number inverse filter is "
"only applied during port validation (not during connection), and added "
"inverse filters for the i.MX board so bootloader-mode serial numbers are "
"excluded. (`ae2cc15b4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ae2cc15b4>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了序列埠開發板偵測，使序號反向篩選器僅在埠驗證期間套用（而非在連接期間），並為 i.MX 開發板新增了反向篩選器，以排除開機載入程式模式的序號。 "
"(`ae2cc15b4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ae2cc15b4>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:213
msgid ""
"Fixed board-type persistence so a previously saved board mapping is no "
"longer overwritten when a manual board-type selection is made. (`c42d36001 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c42d36001>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了開發板類型的保存問題，使先前儲存的開發板對應不再於進行手動開發板類型選擇時被覆寫。 (`c42d36001 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c42d36001>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:216
msgid ""
"Bootloader repair now resolves a hidden board's display name to its "
"architecture string so reconnect/firmware-repair maps the correct board. "
"(`a1de7a09c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a1de7a09c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"開機載入程式修復現在會將隱藏開發板的顯示名稱解析為其架構字串，使重新連接/韌體修復對應到正確的開發板。 (`a1de7a09c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a1de7a09c>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:219
msgid ""
"Board detection now matches board architecture strings case-insensitively. "
"(`7a2e0e93f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7a2e0e93f>`__)"
msgstr ""
"開發板偵測現在會以不分大小寫的方式比對開發板架構字串。 (`7a2e0e93f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7a2e0e93f>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Fixed the device disk failing to mount on quick disconnect/reconnect by "
"persisting the drive-scan thread and retrying drive scans up to three times,"
" and made drive scanning reliably run on the scan thread. (`455dbe967 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/455dbe967>`__, `58c0e5456 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/58c0e5456>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了快速拔除/重新連接時裝置磁碟無法掛載的問題，方法是保留磁碟掃描執行緒並重試磁碟掃描最多三次，並讓磁碟掃描可靠地在掃描執行緒上執行。 "
"(`455dbe967 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/455dbe967>`__, "
"`58c0e5456 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/58c0e5456>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:226
msgid ""
"Fixed the model compiler (ST Edge AI and Vela) failing to run on Intel Macs "
"by allowing the ARM64 tool path when running under Rosetta. (`32e309e86 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/32e309e86>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了模型編譯器（ST Edge AI 與 Vela）在 Intel Mac 上無法執行的問題，方法是在 Rosetta 下執行時允許使用 ARM64 "
"工具路徑。 (`32e309e86 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/32e309e86>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:229
msgid ""
"Fixed Python tool and language-server cache issues by routing all bundled "
"Python ``__pycache__`` into a shared resource directory and pre-warming the "
"i.MX ``blhost`` pycache before the time-limited bootloader connect so "
"flashing no longer times out. (`f64f3330f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f64f3330f>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了 Python 工具與語言伺服器的快取問題，方法是將所有隨附 Python 的 ``__pycache__`` "
"導向至共用資源目錄，並在受時間限制的 i.MX 開機載入程式連接之前預先暖機 ``blhost`` 的 pycache，使燒錄不再逾時。 "
"(`f64f3330f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f64f3330f>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:234
msgid ""
"Fixed the MicroPython header path used by the Python language server (for "
"autocompletion) to resolve from the all-users resource path, and made the "
"all-users resource path lookup more robust when username filtering finds "
"nothing. (`5f2648565 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5f2648565>`__, `fc1938818 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/fc1938818>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了 Python 語言伺服器（用於自動完成）所使用的 MicroPython "
"標頭路徑，使其從全使用者資源路徑解析，並使全使用者資源路徑查找在使用者名稱篩選找不到任何結果時更為穩健。 (`5f2648565 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5f2648565>`__, `fc1938818 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/fc1938818>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:240
msgid ""
"Fixed broken ST Edge AI documentation links in the compiler-options dialog "
"by converting local file paths to proper ``file://`` URLs. (`3ac136444 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3ac136444>`__)"
msgstr ""
"透過將本機檔案路徑轉換為正確的 ``file://`` URL，修正了編譯器選項對話框中損壞的 ST Edge AI 文件連結。 (`3ac136444"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3ac136444>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:243
msgid ""
"Fixed Python editor auto-indentation so lines are no longer incorrectly "
"dedented after a colon-ending (electric) line, e.g. after "
"``if``/``for``/``def`` headers. (`6555f44ba <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6555f44ba>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了 Python 編輯器的自動縮排，使在以冒號結尾（電氣）的行之後（例如 ``if``/``for``/``def`` "
"標頭之後）的行不再被錯誤地反縮排。 (`6555f44ba <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6555f44ba>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:247
msgid ""
"Fixed ROMFS directory record alignment so folder offsets account for the "
"directory name record size, and increased the inter-file delay when "
"unpacking/creating ROMFS and model-zoo files to ensure distinct creation "
"timestamps. (`9bf7e1d9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9bf7e1d9e>`__, `d968a6e46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d968a6e46>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了 ROMFS 目錄記錄的對齊，使資料夾偏移量將目錄名稱記錄的大小納入考量，並增加了解封裝/建立 ROMFS 與 model-zoo "
"檔案時的檔案間延遲，以確保建立時間戳記各不相同。 (`9bf7e1d9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9bf7e1d9e>`__, `d968a6e46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d968a6e46>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:253
msgid ""
"Fixed an integer-overflow in the Vela graph optimiser's mean-to-depthwise-"
"conv conversion by computing the output multiplier in 64-bit, and fixed the "
"basename used in the Vela compiler dialog title/output. (`d217a46e9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d217a46e9>`__, `8376490eb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8376490eb>`__)"
msgstr ""
"透過以 64 位元計算輸出乘數，修正了 Vela 圖形最佳化器在 mean 轉 depthwise-conv 轉換中的整數溢位問題，並修正了 Vela "
"編譯器對話框標題/輸出中使用的基本檔名。 (`d217a46e9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d217a46e9>`__, `8376490eb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8376490eb>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:258
msgid ""
"Fixed restoring the model zoo browser's expanded folders and selected model "
"on reopen, and switched the dialog to heap allocation to avoid GUI lifetime "
"issues. (`84a63ef4c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/84a63ef4c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了重新開啟時還原 model zoo 瀏覽器展開資料夾與選定模型的問題，並將對話框切換為 heap 配置以避免 GUI 生命週期問題。 "
"(`84a63ef4c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/84a63ef4c>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:262
msgid ""
"Fixed the Model Zoo save-as path so the remembered directory is stored as a "
"folder rather than a full filename. (`be877f7af "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/be877f7af>`__)"
msgstr ""
"修正了 Model Zoo 另存新檔的路徑，使記住的目錄以資料夾而非完整檔名的形式儲存。 (`be877f7af "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/be877f7af>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:265
msgid ""
"Kept the legacy user resource path instead of deleting it on startup, "
"avoiding a \"close any programs viewing OpenMV IDE data\" error when the old"
" folder is locked. (`775656775 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/775656775>`__)"
msgstr ""
"保留了舊版使用者資源路徑而非在啟動時將其刪除，避免在舊資料夾被鎖定時出現「close any programs viewing OpenMV IDE "
"data」錯誤。 (`775656775 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/775656775>`__)"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:269
msgid ""
"Fixed the Windows driver installer scripts and catalog/inf files so OpenMV "
"DFU, dfuse, FTDI, Arduino, pybcdc and VCR drivers install reliably and "
"report success codes correctly, hardened the dfuse/vcr DFU driver install "
